'''Mukyakin''' (ムキャキン) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Hikakin Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 7.5 Update|Version 7.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Mukyakin
|image = E 433.png
|appearance = [[Hikakin Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 3,000円 - 11,850円
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy is similar to a tankier but (much) lighter-hitting [[Teacher Bear]] that freezes cats for 1.5 seconds. Has as much range as [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]], but [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] is still safe from his freeze. Still not much of a threat, though not a sentient wallet refill like [[Hikakin (Enemy)|Hikakin]] at least.

==Strategy==
Use ranged attackers like [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] or [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] to take him down.

